{"synopsis":"Yang Li, seorang pria modern, menemukan dirinya menyeberang ke Dunia Purba, tempat takdir berubah secara tak terduga. Apa yang dimulai sebagai perjalanan biasa segera menjadi legendaris saat ia mengalahkan makhluk surgawi, menaklukkan orang bijak, dan menyelamatkan dunia dari malapetaka. Sebuah kisah tentang kecerdasan, kekuatan, dan tekad yang tak tergoyahkan menanti!","alternative_title":"The Primordial World: Starting by Taking the Minghe as My Adopted Stepdaughter","author":"伽行文化","artist":"","chapters":[{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"4257cd1e-a66d-4540-874f-2226b3391528","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2025-04-23"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"4f8373c5-5709-47c6-bddc-6bbe60f5cef1","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2025-04-17"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"5b387632-0b1f-4ec2-83f9-020a7a683d27","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2025-04-17"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"318e2e90-ec87-49c2-aa56-9d49078f9faa","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2025-04-09"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"bc96f0b6-7989-457b-a6ec-1f182104b186","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2025-04-09"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"369862b9-ed2d-493b-9331-2be94bf10365","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2025-04-09"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"234e2c6f-d0d3-4e53-9ca2-06ec3583a618","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2025-04-07"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"8a312db2-7e16-432e-8974-e74b6b573a42","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2025-04-07"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"42b46254-f1f8-42f3-853a-b50a143c6e2e","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2025-03-27"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"3217f445-8882-4b49-b971-046b4c1ed665","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2025-03-27"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"e2a40172-9894-493a-9789-c618e97dde2d","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2025-03-19"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"72d56f4f-1096-4bdf-a65f-ec3f9dde66d1","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2025-03-11"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"3fa04b47-4fd0-49ac-